ar's insurrection is another and  i'm referring to the former president of  the united states uh and his political  ally seeking to whitewash in fact what  happened uh some quoted publicly  claiming that those who attacked the  capitol were just both peaceful  protesters and quote  perhaps nobody knows just how false  those claims are than the women and men  of the us capitol police who were beaten  and bloodied defending  the people inside this building and yes  defending democracy itself so chief what  do you say to those who continue to  perpetuate the lie that lasts january  6th  we are not concerned about  political ideology we're concerned about  behavior we're concerned about people  that break the law  and people break the law  there are extremists on both sides of  the spectrum that are breaking the law  and um we're here to protect the capital  protect the members of congress that's  our mission and i would say to anybody  that um wants to to  come to this capitol  and peacefully demonstrate we will we  will protect your right to do so but  anybody that comes here and decides they  want to break the law that we're going  to do everything in our power to stop  you and to ensure that um  that the capital and the members of  congress remain safe  all right chief i don't think i need a  follow-up question to that but  apparently i do do you think what we saw  in the capital last january 6 was just  another day just people exercising their  constitutional rights  or was it unacceptable  fatal  violence  as i watched um the events of january  6th i was i was at the time um retired i  was at the time watching it on tv and i  was horrified by what i saw i saw police  officers being assaulted  and um that's the reason i'm sitting  here today is because i wanted to do  what i could to to help this police  department and to um uh to better  protect uh our nation and and um the  capital and and the  um  and what this capital represents  thank you for that claire we have some  ongoing work to do well one other quick  question but i'm trying now my time is  up i want to recognize that senator  capital raised  the concern and the questions about the  mental health of the women and men of  the u.s capitol police i share in that  and stand by rather support any  additional resources or support that we  can offer i do have one question about  physical health  we know that  businesses organizations entities
 

